**`src/lib/orchestrator.functions.ts:290-317`** (`dispatchPRDToLinear`). Each task in the dispatch loop does its own sequential `supabase.from("sync_mappings").insert(...)` after the Linear GraphQL call. A 30-task PRD = 30 sequential round trips.

```ts
// before: insert per task, inside the loop
for (const t of toDispatch) {
  const r = await linearGql(...);
  if (r.issueCreate.success) {
    await supabase.from("sync_mappings").insert({ ...t });
  }
}

// after: collect, then one batched insert
const rows = [];
for (const t of toDispatch) {
  const r = await linearGql(...);
  if (r.issueCreate.success) rows.push({ user_id: userId, provider: "linear", local_kind: "task", local_id: t.id, external_id: r.issueCreate.issue.id, external_url: r.issueCreate.issue.url, last_pushed_at: new Date().toISOString(), version_local: 1 });
}
await supabase.from("sync_mappings").insert(rows);
```

**`src/components/knowledge/DocsPanel.tsx:171-175, 645-646`**. Notion search fires a live Notion API call per keystroke — the `useQuery` key is the raw input state. The fix already exists in-repo (`useDebouncedValue` in `src/components/admin/admin-ui.tsx`), just unapplied here.

```tsx
// after
const debouncedNotionQuery = useDebouncedValue(notionQuery, 300);
const notionSearch = useQuery({
  queryKey: ["notion-search", debouncedNotionQuery],
  queryFn: () => fSearchNotion({ data: { query: debouncedNotionQuery } }),
  enabled: notionOpen && debouncedNotionQuery.trim().length > 0,
});
```

**`src/components/knowledge/GraphUniverseCanvas.tsx:531-561`**. Unlike its sibling `GraphForceCanvas.tsx` (which only self-schedules while animating), this loop calls `requestAnimationFrame` forever with no tab-visibility guard.

```ts
const loop = () => {
  if (document.hidden) { rafId.current = requestAnimationFrame(loop); return; }
  // ... existing tick + render
};
```

**`src/components/missions/MissionOrchestratorDetail.tsx:847-853`**. `unattended` (flatMap+filter+sort) is recomputed every render on a component polling every 2.5-4s.

```tsx
const unattended = useMemo(
  () => hops.flatMap(h => h.tool_calls.filter(tc => tc.is_unattended).map(tc => ({...tc, agent_slug: h.agent_slug})))
    .sort((a, b) => new Date(b.created_at).getTime() - new Date(a.created_at).getTime()),
  [hops],
);
```

